// PulsHealth — local (per-developer) build settings. TEMPLATE.
//
// Copy this file to Local.xcconfig, next to it. Running `xcodegen` does this
// for you the first time (project.yml's preGenCommand), so a fresh clone
// generates and builds without any manual step.
//
// Local.xcconfig is gitignored: it is the one place for settings that belong
// to you rather than to the project. Never commit a team ID.
//
// DEVELOPMENT_TEAM — your Apple Developer Team ID (ten characters, shown at
//   https://developer.apple.com/account under Membership). Required for
//   device builds: the HealthKit and background-delivery entitlements need a
//   paid developer team. Simulator builds need no team — leave it empty.
//
// Forks that distribute their own build must also change the bundle
// identifier (options.bundleIdPrefix in project.yml) and must not ship under
// the PulsHealth name — see TRADEMARK.md at the repository root.

DEVELOPMENT_TEAM =
